rences between `开发流程-01-功能点与功能树.md` / `开发流程-02-BDD场景规范.md` and corresponding SKILL.md files; overwrite skills with doc content if different\n   - **Convert 8 MD docs to skills**: Create new skills from `开发流程-03-1-后端BDD.md` through `开发流程-07-E2E测试.md`, each becoming a proper skill with SKILL.md + scripts\n   - **Add 03-user-prompt-submit/ to ALL skills**: Every skill (not just 003 series) must have a `03-user-prompt-submit/` directory where MD files auto-load on skill invocation for learning/evolution\n   - **Create 999-other-120-learn skill**: A new user-invocable skill for writing corrections/supplements to any skill's 03-user-prompt-submit directory\n   - **git commit**: Group and commit all changes following the project's Chinese commit convention\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Skill lifecycle: SKILL.md (frontmatter + spec) + scripts/03UserPromptSubmit.sh (context injection) + scripts/16Stop.sh (cleanup) + 03-user-prompt-submit/ (learning evolution)\n   - Two script output modes: TEXT-mode (001-* series, plain text stdout) vs JSON-mode (002-*, 999-1, 999-2, `{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"UserPromptSubmit\",\"additionalContext\":\"...\"}}`)\n   - 003 series uses inline Python for loading supplementary context; other skills use shared `_load_supplementary.sh`\n   - HARD/GUIDE constraint classification in SKILL.md appendix for proper AI behavior tuning\n   - `_load_supplementary.sh` provides both `$SUPPLEMENTARY_JSON` (JSON-escaped) and `$SUPPLEMENTARY_TEXT` (raw)\n   - Python used for JSON-safe escaping of MD file content (handles quotes, newlines, backslashes)\n   - Skill registration auto-updates `registry.conf` via `skill-register.sh` on 16-stop event\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - **`.claude/skills/_load_supplementary.sh`** (NEW - shared helper)\n     - Shared function `_load_supplementary()` sourced by 13 scripts (001-*, 002-*, 999-1, 999-2)\n     - Provides `$SUPPLEMENTARY_JSON` and `$SUPPLEMENTARY_TEXT` by reading `03-user-prompt-submit/*.md`\n     - Uses Python for JSON escaping, falls back gracefully\n     ```bash\n     _load_supplementary() {\n       local skill_dir=\"$1\"\n       local prompt_dir=\"$skill_dir/03-user-prompt-submit\"\n       SUPPLEMENTARY_JSON=\"\"\n       SUPPLEMENTARY_TEXT=\"\"\n       [ -d \"$prompt_dir\" ] || return 0\n       # count MD files, if any exist use Python to JSON-escape content\n       export _SKILL_PROMPT_DIR=\"$prompt_dir\"\n       SUPPLEMENTARY_JSON=$(python3 -c \"...\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"\")\n       # Also build raw text version\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - **003-1-develop-feature-tree/SKILL.md** (UPDATED)\n     - Synced 3 differences from MD doc: rule 2 rewritten as \"主动确认（强约束）\" with spirit directions, new rule 5 \"前瞻扩展\", completion definition strengthened with explicit user confirmation\n\n   - **003-2-develop-bdd-scenario/SKILL.md** (UPDATED)\n     - Synced 4 differences: scenario writing adds \"思路框架不是模板\", completeness changed from \"三缺一不完整\" to \"起点参考不是封闭清单\", output/definition adjusted\n\n   - **6 new SKILL.md files** (003-3-1 through 003-7)\n     - Each contains frontmatter (name, description, user-invocable, allowed-tools) + full MD document content including HARD/GUIDE appendix\n     - allowed-tools: Bash, Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep\n\n   - **003 series 03UserPromptSubmit.sh** (8 files, inline Python approach)\n     - Uses Python to load MD files and output complete JSON\n     ```bash\n     if [ -d \"$PROMPT_DIR\" ]; then\n       export _SKILL_PROMPT_DIR=\"$PROMPT_DIR\"\n       python3 -c \"\n     import glob, json, os\n     parts = []\n     d = os.environ.get('_SKILL_PROMPT_DIR', '').replace(os.sep, '/')\n     if d and os.path.isdir(d):\n         for f in sorted(glob.glob(d + '/*.md')):\n             try:\n                 with open(f, encoding='utf-8') as fh:\n                     parts.append(fh.read())\n             except: pass\n     context = chr(10).join(parts) if parts else ''\n     print(json.dumps({'hookSpecificOutput': {'hookEventName': 'UserPromptSubmit', 'additionalContext': context}}))\n     \" 2>/dev/null || echo '{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"UserPromptSubmit\",\"additionalContext\":\"\"}}'\n     else\n       echo '{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"UserPromptSubmit\",\"additionalContext\":\"\"}}'\n     fi\n     ```\n\n   - **TEXT-mode scripts** (001-1 through 001-9, appended loading block)\n     - Appended at end of each script:\n     ```bash\n     # 补充上下文：从 03-user-prompt-submit/ 加载学习进化内容\n     source \"$PROJECT_DIR/.claude/skills/_load_supplementary.sh\"\n     _load_supplementary \"$PROJECT_DIR/.claude/skills/${SKILL_TAG}\"\n     if [ -n \"$SUPPLEMENTARY_TEXT\" ]; then\n       echo \"\"\n       echo \"=== 补充上下文 ===\"\n       echo \"$SUPPLEMENTARY_TEXT\"\n     fi\n     ```\n\n   - **JSON-mode scripts** (002-1, 002-2, 999-1, 999-2, inserted before final echo)\n     - Inserted before final echo line via sed:\n     ```bash\n     # 补充上下文：从 03-user-prompt-submit/ 加载学习进化内容\n     source \"$PROJECT_DIR/.claude/skills/_load_supplementary.sh\"\n     _load_supplementary \"$PROJECT_DIR/.claude/skills/${SKILL_TAG}\"\n     if [ -n \"$SUPPLEMENTARY_JSON\" ]; then\n       CONTEXT=\"${CONTEXT}\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n${SUPPLEMENTARY_JSON}\"\n     fi\n     ```\n\n   - **999-other-120-learn/SKILL.md** (NEW - learning evolution skill)\n     - 5-step workflow: confirm target skill → understand problem → read existing context → write supplement file → confirm生效\n     - Supports 4 operation types: 修正/补充/经验/定制\n     - Supports query: list/view/delete existing supplements\n     - File naming: `{序号}-{类型}-{简述}.md`\n\n   - **24 `03-user-prompt-submit/README.md` files** (NEW)\n     - Identical README explaining purpose, naming convention, and usage notes\n\n   - **doc/otherDoc/2026-06-03/** (9 files MODIFIED)\n     - Added \"附录：转 Skill 约束分级（注入指引）\" HARD/GUIDE sections to all docs\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Write tool error on 003-2 SKILL.md**: \"File has not been read yet\" - needed 