6\n    style G fill:#ff9\n```\n\n### 3.2 Model 优先级\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"Model 解析\"] --> B{\"profile 有 model?\"}\n    B -- 有 --> M1[\"使用 profile.model<br/>（强制覆盖）\"]\n    B -- 无 --> C{\"~/.claude.json 有 model?\"}\n    C -- 有 --> M2[\"使用 ~/.claude.json model<br/>（默认兜底）\"]\n    C -- 无 --> M3[\"Model = 空<br/>（不做替换，原样透传）\"]\n\n    style M1 fill:#6f6\n    style M2 fill:#ff9\n    style M3 fill:#ddd\n```\n\n**说明**：配置按 5 级优先级解析：CLI 参数 > Profile > 环境变量 > ~/.claude.json > 默认值。Model 单独解析：profile.model > ~/.claude.json model > 空（不改写）。"},"tool_use_id":"call_839d517fa24d4f65bd003298","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\redeme\\claude-tap-plus-diagrams.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
