[2026-06-06 19:52:03] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"ae44a20e-0554-47dc-ab1c-0a69354064e9","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\ae44a20e-0554-47dc-ab1c-0a69354064e9.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"default","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\redeme\\claude-tap-plus-diagrams.md","limit":80},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\redeme\\claude-tap-plus-diagrams.md","content":"# claude_tap_plus 流程图集\n\n本文档包含 claude_tap_plus 项目的所有 Mermaid 图表。配合 [claude-tap-plus-architecture.md](claude-tap-plus-architecture.md) 阅读效果更佳。\n\n---\n\n## 1. 系统总体架构图\n\n展示三大子系统：代理模式、后端服务、会话管理的关系。\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TB\n    subgraph CLI 入口\n        MAIN[\"cmd/claude-tap/main.go<br/>子命令分发\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 代理模式\n        CONFIG[\"config/<br/>配置解析\"]\n        PROXY[\"proxy/<br/>HTTP 反向代理\"]\n        SSE[\"sse/<br/>SSE 流重组\"]\n        TRACE[\"trace/<br/>JSONL 追踪\"]\n        USAGE[\"usage/<br/>Token 归一化\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 后端服务\n        API[\"backend/api/<br/>HTTP 处理器\"]\n        SVC[\"backend/service/<br/>业务逻辑\"]\n        STORE[\"backend/store/<br/>SQLite 持久化\"]\n        DOMAIN[\"backend/domain/<br/>实体定义\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 会话管理\n        SESSION[\"session/<br/>Push/Pull/Status\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 基础设施\n        LOGGER[\"logger/<br/>统一日志\"]\n    end\n\n    MAIN -->|\"默认子命令\"| PROXY\n    MAIN -->|\"backend 子命令\"| API\n    MAIN -->|\"session-push/pull/status\"| SESSION\n\n    PROXY --> CONFIG & SSE & TRACE & LOGGER\n    SSE --> USAGE & LOGGER\n    TRACE --> USAGE & LOGGER\n    CONFIG --> LOGGER\n\n    API --> SVC & LOGGER\n    SVC --> STORE & LOGGER\n    STORE --> DOMAIN & LOGGER\n\n    SESSION --> TRACE & LOGGER\n\n    style MAIN fill:#4a90d9,color:#fff\n    style LOGGER fill:#888,color:#fff\n```\n\n**说明**：三大子系统共用 `logger/` 基础设施。代理模式包含完整的 API 流量拦截管线（config → proxy → sse → trace → usage），后端服务采用三层架构（api → service → store），会话管理独立运行。\n\n---\n\n## 2. 代理模式数据流图\n\n从 CLI 启动到 Trace 文件写入的完整数据流。\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"CLI 启动<br/>main.go\"] --> B[\"配置解析<br/>ResolveTargetConfig()\"]\n    B --> B1[\"model 优先级链<br/>profile.model > ~/.claude.json model > 空\"]\n    B --> C[\"创建代理<br/>NewReverseProxy(target, traceDir)\"]\n    C --> C1[\"SetModel(resolved.Model)<br/>设置 model 改写\"]\n    C1 --> C2[\"loadFallbackConfig()<br/>读取 ~/.claude/settings.json\"]\n    C2 --> C3[\"SetFallbackConfig(fallback)<br/>设置兜底配置\"]\n    C3 --> D[\"启动本地代理<br/>proxy.Start(127.0.0.1, port)\"]\n    D --> E[\"启动 Claude Code 子进程<br/>设置 ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=proxy\"]\n\n    E --> F[\"Claude Code 发送 API 请求\"]\n    F --> G[\"代理拦截请求<br/>serveHTTP()\"]\n","numLines":80,"startLine":1,"totalLines":514}},"tool_use_id":"call_e815411c496a417d816c9fa7","duration_ms":7}
