n**Store 聚合接口**：\n```go\ntype Store interface {\n    Issues() IssueStore\n    Sessions() SessionStore\n    Close() error\n}\n```\n\n**辅助类型**：\n\n```go\ntype ClaimResult struct {\n    Success   bool\n    Status    string\n    ClaimedBy *string\n    ClaimedAt *string\n}","numLines":50,"startLine":858,"totalLines":1262}},"tool_use_id":"call_58a7cad3d9b8446c95d3acf9","duration_ms":5}
