truct)\n\n### `proxies` 表\n\n| 列名 | 类型 | 约束 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `proxy_id` | TEXT | PRIMARY KEY |\n| `project_slug` | TEXT | NOT NULL |\n| `status` | TEXT | NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active' |\n| `registered_at` | DATETIME | NOT NULL |\n| `last_ping_at` | DATETIME | |\n\n索引: `idx_proxies_status(status)`, `idx_proxies_project(project_slug)`\n\n(注: `proxies` 表没有对应的 domain struct)"}],"totalDurationMs":37964,"totalTokens":24094,"totalToolUseCount":7,"usage":{"input_tokens":1803,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":20480,"output_tokens":1811,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":6,"searchCount":1,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"tool_use_id":"call_01a6460ae9464f75856abdff","duration_ms":37964}
