[2026-06-06 20:05:07] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"eeb8e205-3667-4e86-8031-0905d852add4","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\eeb8e205-3667-4e86-8031-0905d852add4.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","agent_id":"afc0daed65080ae7d","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-3-1-backend-bdd\\SKILL.md","limit":30},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:/CodeDevelopment/CodeProject/claude-hk/.claude/skills/003-3-1-backend-bdd/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: 003-3-1-backend-bdd\ndescription: 后端 BDD：将 BDD 场景拆解为后端可验证的行为场景，驱动后端 TDD\nuser-invocable: true\nallowed-tools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n  - Write\n  - Edit\n  - Glob\n  - Grep\n---\n\n# 单项目开发流程 — 后端 BDD（Backend）\n\n> 文档日期：2026-06-03\n> 所属系列：单项目开发完整流程\n> 阶段定位：将 BDD 场景 拆解为后端可验证的行为场景\n\n---\n\n## 一、核心目标\n\n- 将 BDD 场景拆解为后端可验证的场景\n- 描述后端功能接口在各类条件下的行为\n- 驱动后端 TDD 编写单元测试\n\n---\n\n## 二、阶段职责","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":283}},"tool_use_id":"call_68dfd5b5511647dea9507065","duration_ms":1}
