[2026-06-06 20:05:08] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"eeb8e205-3667-4e86-8031-0905d852add4","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\eeb8e205-3667-4e86-8031-0905d852add4.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","agent_id":"afc0daed65080ae7d","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-4-api-contract\\SKILL.md","limit":30},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:/CodeDevelopment/CodeProject/claude-hk/.claude/skills/003-4-api-contract/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: 003-4-api-contract\ndescription: API 契约：根据后端 BDD 和前端 BDD 定义前后端接口契约，回填更新 BDD 文档\nuser-invocable: true\nallowed-tools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n  - Write\n  - Edit\n  - Glob\n  - Grep\n---\n\n# 单项目开发流程 — API 契约 / 数据结构\n\n> 文档日期：2026-06-03\n> 所属系列：单项目开发完整流程\n> 阶段定位：根据后端 BDD 和前端 BDD 进行前后端接口对齐\n\n---\n\n## 一、核心目标\n\n- 根据后端 BDD 和前端 BDD 的输出，定义前后端接口契约\n- 多个后端/前端场景可以共享同一个接口，不是 1:1 映射\n- 契约确认后，回填更新后端 BDD 和前端 BDD，将抽象的\"功能接口\"替换为实际接口\n- 只到接口层面，不涉及更深层次的实现\n\n---\n","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":323}},"tool_use_id":"call_27efe1107fbd47d38cacbc62","duration_ms":1}
