[2026-06-06 20:05:08] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"eeb8e205-3667-4e86-8031-0905d852add4","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\eeb8e205-3667-4e86-8031-0905d852add4.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","agent_id":"afc0daed65080ae7d","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-5-1-backend-tdd-java\\SKILL.md","limit":30},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:/CodeDevelopment/CodeProject/claude-hk/.claude/skills/003-5-1-backend-tdd-java/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: 003-5-1-backend-tdd-java\ndescription: 后端 TDD（Java/SpringBoot）：根据后端 BDD 写单元测试，通过 Red-Green-Refactor 驱动代码实现\nuser-invocable: true\nallowed-tools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n  - Write\n  - Edit\n  - Glob\n  - Grep\n---\n\n# 单项目开发流程 — 后端 TDD（Test Driven Development）\n\n> 文档日期：2026-06-03\n> 所属系列：单项目开发完整流程\n> 阶段定位：根据后端 BDD 写 Java/SpringBoot 单元测试，通过测试驱动代码实现\n\n---\n\n## 一、核心目标\n\n- 从后端 BDD 场景生成 Java 单元测试\n- 通过 Red-Green-Refactor 循环驱动代码实现\n- 保证所有服务层和数据库逻辑符合后端 BDD\n- 遵循 SpringBoot 测试规范\n\n---\n","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":657}},"tool_use_id":"call_7faa773c0e0246369c564415","duration_ms":1}
