sions` | 获取会话列表 |\n| `/api/proxy/register`, `/unregister`, `/trace-init` | 代理注册/注销/trace-init 转发 |\n| `/api/proxies` | 代理列表 |\n| `/api/machines` | 机器列表 |\n| `/api/projects` | 项目列表 |\n| `/api/logs` | 日志查询 |\n| `/api/config` | 配置读写 |\n| `/api/status` | 系统状态 |\n\n**领域模型**:\n- **Session**: session_id, machine_id, os, project_slug, model, source(startup/resume), status(active/closed)\n- **Machine**: machine_id(username@hostname), os, hostname, username, first/last seen\n- **Project**: project_slug, project_cwd, first/last seen\n- **IssueClaim**: repo_full_name + issue_number, status 流转, session_id\n- **TokenStats**: api_calls, input/output tokens, cache read/create\n\n**空闲 Watchdog** (`D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\internal\\backend\\service\\idle_watchdog.go`):\n- 每 30 秒检查 proxy.json 中活跃会话数\n- 持续空闲 10 分钟则自动关闭后端服务"}],"totalDurationMs":78015,"totalTokens":70633,"totalToolUseCount":36,"usage":{"input_tokens":5431,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":62528,"output_tokens":2674,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":29,"searchCount":7,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"tool_use_id":"call_95c5e81e9c3a4e8ba335700a","duration_ms":78015}
